{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408350/extras/5e294103758134747e7e850cb901ce94.avif?t=1767299914\" width=780 height=131 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hermit and Pig set out one morning to forage mushrooms and avoid human interaction, but an unexpected visitor plunges them into a conspiracy well above their pay grade. Which is zero dollars.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>KEY COMBO COMBAT!</strong></i><strong> </strong>Enter fighting-game-inspired key combos to complete different moves against over 100 enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>RACE AGAINST THE CLOCK!</strong></i><strong>\u00a0</strong>Battles are turn-based, but there\u2019s no waiting around. Complete your move before the timer runs out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>BATTLE YOUR SOCIAL ANXIETY!</strong></i><strong>\u00a0</strong>For a hermit, conversations are like personal battles. Say something awkward and take real cringe damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>FORAGE FOR MUSHROOMS, TRUFFLES AND TRINKETS!</strong></i> Mushrooms and truffles will help you defend yourself. Equip trinkets to enhance Hermit and Pig.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>LEAVE YOUR COMFORT ZONE!</i></strong> Keep your wits about you as you hunt for a giant, mythical mushroom and navigate a path filled with corporate stooges, weird cultists, rival truffle hunters, and uncharacteristically violent animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>PLAY YOUR WAY!</strong></i><strong> </strong>Don\u2019t like key combos? Change the battle style. Don\u2019t like timers? Turn them off. Just want to enjoy the story? Turn on story mode. Hermit and Pig is for everyone.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2408350?t=1767299914","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408350/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767299914","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408350/1823396b9fb5f5a2f50b28207de7c0ba108472e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767299914","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408350/1823396b9fb5f5a2f50b28207de7c0ba108472e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767299914","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3036090,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408350/extras/5e294103758134747e7e850cb901ce94.avif?t=1767299914\" width=780 height=131 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hermit and Pig set out one morning to forage mushrooms and avoid human interaction, but an unexpected visitor plunges them into a conspiracy well above their pay grade. Which is zero dollars.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>KEY COMBO COMBAT!</strong></i><strong> </strong>Enter fighting-game-inspired key combos to complete different moves against over 100 enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>RACE AGAINST THE CLOCK!</strong></i><strong>\u00a0</strong>Battles are turn-based, but there\u2019s no waiting around. Complete your move before the timer runs out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>BATTLE YOUR SOCIAL ANXIETY!</strong></i><strong>\u00a0</strong>For a hermit, conversations are like personal battles. Say something awkward and take real cringe damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>FORAGE FOR MUSHROOMS, TRUFFLES AND TRINKETS!</strong></i> Mushrooms and truffles will help you defend yourself. Equip trinkets to enhance Hermit and Pig.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>LEAVE YOUR COMFORT ZONE!</i></strong> Keep your wits about you as you hunt for a giant, mythical mushroom and navigate a path filled with corporate stooges, weird cultists, rival truffle hunters, and uncharacteristically violent animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>PLAY YOUR WAY!</strong></i><strong> </strong>Don\u2019t like key combos? Change the battle style. Don\u2019t like timers? Turn them off. Just want to enjoy the story? Turn on story mode. Hermit and Pig is for everyone.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Heavy Lunch Studio LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408350/66be17116998473886db9a042527e5b999ad05b3/header.jpg?t=1767299914","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"A trademark application for the mark HERMIT AND PIG has been filed with the U.S. Patent and Trademark Office.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 14+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.15<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel 2Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamst